* Simple MIX program to add two numbers
* This program adds the contents of location 1000 to location 1001
* and stores the result in location 1002
        ORIG 0
START   LDA  1000      Load the first number into register A
        ADD  1001      Add the second number
        STA  1002      Store the result
        HLT            Halt the program
        ORIG 1000
        CON  42        First number (42)
        CON  58        Second number (58)
        CON  0         Result will be stored here
        END  START